    "clm-apss-applications-app02": {
      "text": "Peyton Jones, Eber and Seward propose defining financial contracts compositionally rather than expanding a fixed catalog. The paper describes a Haskell combinator library and compositional valuation semantics. The examples combine payments and reverse parties' rights/obligations with `give`.",
